<title>CROATIA: TENNIS-CROATIAN OPEN SECOND ROUND RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-CROATIAN OPEN SECOND ROUND RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>BOL, Croatia 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Second round results in the $107,500 Croatian Open Women's WTA Tennis Tournament on Wednesday (all players unseeded):</p>
<p>Joanette Kruger (SAfrica) beat Ana Alcazar (Spain) 3-6 6-4 6-0</p>
<p>Emmanuelle Gagliardi (U.S.) beat Silvija Talaja (Croatia) 6-3 3-6 6-4</p>
<p>Marion Maruska (Austria) beat Sandra Kleinova (Czech) 6-2 6-4</p>
<p>Corina Moriariu (U.S.) beat Denisa Chladkova (Czech) 6-4 7-6</p>
</text>
